  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Networking Highlight Notice for International Development 2017 - The Roles of IP and Diversity in the Creative Industries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research network exploring how different cultural traditions impact both IP rights and equaity &amp; diversity in the creative industries. Beneficiaries: UK &amp; South Africa creative industries, culture industry &amp; academics. SDGs: 10,8,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
